// The sensor is the engine's dht22 device, which reads the scene's temperature and humidity and
// answers a host's start pulse on DATA with the AM2302 manual's 40 bits and timing. Its internal
// pull-up is a second model, a resistor from VDD to DATA. The output and input levels are table
// 4 of Aosong's AM2302 product manual v1.1, at VDD 5 V.
{
  "format": 1,
